    "GroupName": "OR0",
    "Description": "OR reading (inputs A and B, threshold 0.25) of the shipped 'Logic Gate OR-AND' gate. Role in the 4-bit zero detect: first stage, low half — OR0 = A0 OR A1. The zero flag composes at the logic layer, not optically: every gate's truth table is extracted once in isolation, so each stage restores clean 0/1 levels by construction and the tree evaluates without feedback.",
