  {
   "GroupDto": {
    "GroupName": "NOTZ",
    "Description": "NOT reading (input A, BIAS constantly on, threshold 0.375) of the shipped 'Logic Gate NOT-NAND' gate. Role in the 4-bit zero detect: the final inversion — Z = NOT(any A bit) — so Z shines only when the whole word is dark (A == 0). The zero flag composes at the logic layer, not optically: every gate's truth table is extracted once in isolation, so each stage restores clean 0/1 levels by construction.",
    "Identifier": "group_2022d713cae44edf82408fade28c3adf",
